        "106402"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1658c6fbabc686e276ca497",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "尝尝。好吃到上天哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "a79fdd12094797766c531bbd1a88580d85e8e5a5588794b977a7c97d04ea27ab",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "271",
        "106501"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ac7e8d14eff47a612e2cf06",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "吃吃看。好吃到飞起哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b4f988859980b19d464c13fb6a3b3ee4fb9dc260bbe6d920eed9227a7e6d2f4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "271",
        "106502"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1adc36a7ac5c56c5dd06849f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我　的训练员不怎么生气！\\n想　这句想不出来！\\n感　觉训练员很努力！\\n谢　谢善待三涡轮！\\n你　快吃吧！很好吃！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1b5a90d12ed1f873a6115a46db2ee516360467f3add1bba3a8b6a35593d0fe3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "271",
        "106601"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8935faf676e21d76acc0e79f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员。\\n托您的福，我的光芒变得更加夺目了。我眼中\\n所映出的您，就如一流的宝石雕刻师那般技术\\n超群。如果要给您送上礼物的话，我想只有这\\n个最为合适。我亲手刻下的光辉，请一定要收下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ba7b5b3ee1dc5231caa301fd1f7002953b59b3b6afd3f64355ef1efbf2dd1a9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "271",
        "106701"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:788d8ecc5f4cf112822eb9ce",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员。\\n托您的福，我的光芒变得更加夺目了。我眼中\\n所映出的您，就如一流的宝石雕刻师那般技术\\n超群。如果要给您送上礼物的话，我想只有这\\n个最为合适。我亲手刻下的光辉，请一定要收下。",
